      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To check the account, we start by verifying the amount."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If the amount is less than 200 \u20ac,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "we proceed to approve the expense report."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "However, if the amount is 200 \u20ac or more,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "we evaluate the expense report."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "If the expense report is deemed acceptable,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "it is approved"
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "and the process comes to an end."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "On the other hand, if the expense report is not satisfactory, the process also ends."
